      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Your egg was incubated by a violet drachiri, and your body has been imbued by their influence. You have reflective scales and might have a prominent horn on your snout or forehead, both of which resemble metal or gemstones. You gain the Exemplary Qualities feat twice, selecting Violet as your Benefactor. Whenever you succeed on a saving throw against an effect with the Mental trait, you critically succeed instead.</span></p>"
